  <entry>
    <title>MIPS ?</title>
    <url>/czyyy_nlw/2026/10/20/MIPS/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h1 id="常用的一些宏"><a href="#常用的一些宏" class="headerlink" title="常用的一些宏"></a>常用的一些宏</h1><ol>
<li>输入 <figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro input(%in)   #输入一个整数</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 5</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">    move %in, $v0</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">.macro input_char(%in)   #输入一个字符</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 12</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">    move %in, $v0</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">.macro input_str(%addr, %max_len)    #输入一个字符串</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0,8</span><br><span class="line">    la $a0, %addr</span><br><span class="line">    move $a1, %max_len</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>输出<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro print(%out)  # 输出一个整数</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 1</span><br><span class="line">    move $a0, %out</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">.macro print_char(%out) # 打印一个字符</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 11</span><br><span class="line">    move $a0, %out</span><br><span class="line">     syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">.macro print_str(%addr) # 打印一个字符串</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 4</span><br><span class="line">    la $a0, %addr </span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>退出程序<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro exit()</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 10</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>打印换行<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro println()</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 11</span><br><span class="line">    li $a0, 10</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>打印空格<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro printspace()</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 11</span><br><span class="line">    li $a0, 32</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>计算二维数组字节偏移量<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro calc_addr(%dst, %row, %col, %rank)</span><br><span class="line">    multu %row, %rank</span><br><span class="line">    mflo %dst</span><br><span class="line">    addu %dst, %dst %col</span><br><span class="line">    sll %dst, %dst, 2</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>读数组元素 arr[index] -&gt; %val (用到$t9)<br>字符串：去掉sll，lw -&gt; lb<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro lw_arr(%val, %base, %index)</span><br><span class="line">    sll $t9, %index, 2</span><br><span class="line">    add $t9, %base, $t9</span><br><span class="line">    lw %val, 0($t9)</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>写数组元素 %val -&gt; arr[index] (用到$t9)<br>字符串：去掉sll，lw -&gt; lb <figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro sw_arr(%val, %base, %index)</span><br><span class="line">    sll $t9, %index, 2</span><br><span class="line">    add $t9, %base, $t9</span><br><span class="line">    sw %val, 0($t9)</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<hr>
</li>
</ol>
<h1 id="循环的写法"><a href="#循环的写法" class="headerlink" title="循环的写法"></a>循环的写法</h1><ol>
<li>单循环 <figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># s0 = n </span><br><span class="line"># 初始化</span><br><span class="line">li $t0, 0  # t0 = i = 0</span><br><span class="line">for_loop:</span><br><span class="line">    beq $t0, $s0, end_for</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">     # code</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    addi $t0, $t0, 1</span><br><span class="line">    j for_loop</span><br><span class="line">end_for:</span><br><span class="line">    # over</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>双循环<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># s0 = n</span><br><span class="line"># s1 = m</span><br><span class="line"># 初始化</span><br><span class="line">li	$t0, 0	# t0 = i = 0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">loop_i:</span><br><span class="line"> beq	$t0, $s0, end_loop_i</span><br><span class="line"> li	$t1, 0					# t1 = j = 0</span><br><span class="line">loop_j:</span><br><span class="line"> beq	$t1, $s1, end_loop_j</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> # code</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> addi	$t1, $t1, 1				# j++</span><br><span class="line"> j	loop_j</span><br><span class="line">end_loop_j:</span><br><span class="line"> addi	$t0, $t0, 1				# i++</span><br><span class="line"> j	i</span><br><span class="line">end_loop_i:</span><br><span class="line"> # over</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<hr>
</li>
</ol>
<h1 id="递归"><a href="#递归" class="headerlink" title="递归"></a>递归</h1><ol>
<li><p>可分为线性递归，树形递归，循环递归</p>
</li>
<li><p>入栈出栈宏</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro push(%src)</span><br><span class="line">    addi $sp, $sp, -4</span><br><span class="line">    sw %src, 0($sp)</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">.macro pop(%src)</span><br><span class="line">    lw %src, 0($sp)</span><br><span class="line">    addi $sp, $sp, 4</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li><p>写法</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">func:</span><br><span class="line">     # 1. 基线条件处理(停止递归)</span><br><span class="line">     beq $a0, $zero, base_case</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">     # 2. 压栈</span><br><span class="line">     push($ra)</span><br><span class="line">     push($a0)</span><br><span class="line"> </span><br><span class="line">     # 3. 递归准备与调用</span><br><span class="line">     addi $a0, $a0, -1   # 修改参数，准备下一层的入参</span><br><span class="line">     </span><br><span class="line">     jal func    # 递归调用</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">     move $s0, $v0   #存值（如果第二次还要调用）</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">     # 恢复参数</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">     # 4. 合并结果</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">     # 5. 弹栈</span><br><span class="line">     pop($a0)</span><br><span class="line">     pop($ra)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> base_case:  # 出口设置</span><br><span class="line">     xxx</span><br><span class="line">     jr $ra</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<hr>
</li>
</ol>
]]></content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>P3 设计文档</title>
    <url>/czyyy_nlw/2026/10/27/P3%20%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h1 id="P3-设计文档"><a href="#P3-设计文档" class="headerlink" title="P3 设计文档"></a>P3 设计文档</h1><hr>
<h2 id="查指令集"><a href="#查指令集" class="headerlink" title="查指令集"></a>查指令集</h2><p><img src="/czyyy_nlw/img/P3/add.png" alt="add" title="add"><br><img src="/czyyy_nlw/img/P3/sub.png" alt="sub" title="sub"><br><img src="/czyyy_nlw/img/P3/ori.png" alt="ori" title="ori"><br><img src="/czyyy_nlw/img/P3/lw.png" alt="lw" title="lw"><br><img src="/czyyy_nlw/img/P3/sw.png" alt="sw" title="sw"><br><img src="/czyyy_nlw/img/P3/beq.png" alt="beq" title="beq"><br><img src="/czyyy_nlw/img/P3/lui.png" alt="lui" title="lui"></p>
<hr>
<h2 id="模块"><a href="#模块" class="headerlink" title="模块"></a>模块</h2><h3 id="IFU"><a href="#IFU" class="headerlink" title="IFU"></a>IFU</h3><ol>
<li>PC<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>变量</th>
<th>方向</th>
<th>位宽</th>
<th>解释</th>
<th>来源&#x2F;去向</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>clk</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>reset</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>NPC</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>下一条指令地址</td>
<td>NPC.NPC</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>PC</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>当前指令地址</td>
<td>IM.Addr</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</li>
<li>IM<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>变量</th>
<th>方向</th>
<th>位宽</th>
<th>解释</th>
<th>来源&#x2F;去向</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Addr</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>指令地址</td>
<td>PC</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Data</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>指令码</td>
<td>Controller&#x2F;GRF&#x2F;EXT</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</li>
<li>NPC<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>变量</th>
<th>方向</th>
<th>位宽</th>
<th>解释</th>
<th>来源&#x2F;去向</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>PC</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>当前指令</td>
<td>PC.PC</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>imm26</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>26</td>
<td>j, jal跳转地址</td>
<td>IM.Data[25:0]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>GRF</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>寄存器输入</td>
<td>jr，jarl跳转地址</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>imm16</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>16</td>
<td>相对跳转地址</td>
<td>IM.Data[15:0]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>NPC_Sel</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>2</td>
<td>最终NPC输出选择</td>
<td>Controller.NPC_Sel</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>zero</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>相对跳转指令条件成功</td>
<td>ALU.zero</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>NPC</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>下一条指令地址</td>
<td>PC.NPC</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
 zero &#x3D; 0 : NPC &#x3D; PC + 4; zero &#x3D; 1 :<br> NPC &#x3D; (NPC_Sel &#x3D; 0 : PC + 4; 1 : PC + imm26; 3 : GRF; 4 : PC + 4 + 16)</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="GRF"><a href="#GRF" class="headerlink" title="GRF"></a>GRF</h3><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>变量</th>
<th>方向</th>
<th>位宽</th>
<th>解释</th>
<th>来源&#x2F;去向</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>clk</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>reset</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>WE</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>写使能</td>
<td>Controller.RegWrite</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>A1</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>5</td>
<td>RD1寄存器编号</td>
<td>IM.Data[25:21]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>A2</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>5</td>
<td>RD2寄存器编号</td>
<td>IM.Data[20:16]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>A3</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>5</td>
<td>写入寄存器编号</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>WD</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>输入信号</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>RD1</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>A1寄存器数据</td>
<td>ALU.inputA</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>RD2</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>A2寄存器数据</td>
<td>ALUsrc-MUX</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>A3 : (Regra) ? 5’h1f :<br>    (RegDst) ? IM.Data[15:11] : IM.Data[20:16];</p>
<p>WD : (PCtoReg) ? PCplus4 :<br>    (MemtoReg) ? DM.Data : ALU.outputA;</p>
<h3 id="ALU"><a href="#ALU" class="headerlink" title="ALU"></a>ALU</h3><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>变量</th>
<th>方向</th>
<th>位宽</th>
<th>解释</th>
<th>来源&#x2F;去向</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>type</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>4</td>
<td>具体指令种类</td>
<td>Controller.type</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>inputA</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>第一个运算数</td>
<td>GRF.RD1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>inputB</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>第二个运算数</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>outputA</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>运算结果</td>
<td>MemtoReg-MUX(0)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>zero</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>相对跳转指令条件成功</td>
<td>NPC.zero</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>inputB : (ALUsrc) ? EXTop.ext32 : GRF.RD2;</p>
<h3 id="DM"><a href="#DM" class="headerlink" title="DM"></a>DM</h3><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>变量</th>
<th>方向</th>
<th>位宽</th>
<th>解释</th>
<th>来源&#x2F;去向</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>clk</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>reset</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>WE</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>写使能</td>
<td>Controller.MemWrite</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Addr</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>写入地址</td>
<td>ALU.outputA</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>WD</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>写入数据</td>
<td>GRF.RD2</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Data</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>回写数据</td>
<td>MemtoReg-MUX(1)</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h3 id="EXT"><a href="#EXT" class="headerlink" title="EXT"></a>EXT</h3><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>变量</th>
<th>方向</th>
<th>位宽</th>
<th>解释</th>
<th>来源&#x2F;去向</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>imm16</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>16</td>
<td>待扩展立即数</td>
<td>IM.Data[15:0]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>EXtop</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>扩展类型选择</td>
<td>Controller.EXTop</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>ext32</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>32</td>
<td>扩展后立即数</td>
<td>ALUsrc-MUX(1)</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>EXTop &#x3D; 0 : 无符号扩展；EXTop &#x3D; 1 : 符号扩展</p>
<h3 id="Controller"><a href="#Controller" class="headerlink" title="Controller"></a>Controller</h3><p>使用优先编码器Priority Encoder，将具体指令转为type（nop指令的type为0）</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>变量</th>
<th>方向</th>
<th>位宽</th>
<th>解释</th>
<th>来源&#x2F;去向</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>OpCode</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>6</td>
<td>指令OpCode</td>
<td>IM.Data[31:26]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Funct</td>
<td>in</td>
<td>6</td>
<td>指令Funct</td>
<td>IM.Data[5:0]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>NPC_Sel</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>2</td>
<td>最终NPC输出选择</td>
<td>NPC.NPC_Sel</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>RegWrite</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>GRF写使能</td>
<td>GRF.WE</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>EXTop</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>EXT扩展类型选择</td>
<td>EXT.EXTop</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>ALUsrc</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>ALU第二运算数来源选择</td>
<td>ALUsrc-MUX</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>RegDst</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>GRF.A3数据来源选择</td>
<td>RegDst-MUX</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>MemWrite</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>DM写使能</td>
<td>DM.WE</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>MemtoReg</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>回写(访存)选择</td>
<td>MemtoReg-MUX</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>PCtoReg</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>$ra选择</td>
<td>PCtoReg-MUX</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Regra</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>是否选择$ra</td>
<td>Regra-MUX</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>type</td>
<td>out</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>指令类型</td>
<td>ALU.type</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h4 id="选择信号汇总："><a href="#选择信号汇总：" class="headerlink" title="选择信号汇总："></a>选择信号汇总：</h4><ol>
<li>zero, NPC_Sel : zero &#x3D; 0 : NPC &#x3D; PC + 4;<br> zero &#x3D; 1 : NPC &#x3D; (NPC_Sel &#x3D; 0 : PC + 4; 1 : PC + imm26; 2 : GRF; 3 : PC + 4 + 16);</li>
<li>RegWrite : GRF写使能</li>
<li>EXTop : EXTop &#x3D; 0 : 无符号扩展；EXTop &#x3D; 1 : 符号扩展</li>
<li>ALUsrc : inputB : (ALUsrc) ? EXTop.ext32 : GRF.RD2;</li>
<li>RegDst, Regra: A3 : (Regra) ? 5’h1f :<br> (RegDst) ? IM.Data[15:11] : IM.Data[20:16];</li>
<li>MemWrite : DM写使能</li>
<li>MemtoReg, PCtoReg : WD : (PCtoReg) ? PCplus4 :<br> (MemtoReg) ? DM.Data : ALU.outputA;</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h2 id="测试方案"><a href="#测试方案" class="headerlink" title="测试方案"></a>测试方案</h2><p>ori $4, $0, 123<br>ori $5, $4, 456<br>ori $9, $0, 0<br>ori $10, $0, 1<br>ori $11, $0, 65535<br>ori $15, $0, 65534<br>ori $24, $0, 25779</p>
<p>lui $6, 123<br>lui $7, 0xffff<br>ori $7, $7, 0xffff<br>lui $12, 0x7fff<br>ori $12, $12, 0xffff<br>lui $13, 0x8000</p>
<p>add $16, $4, $6<br>add $17, $4, $7<br>add $18, $7, $7<br>add $19, $12, $7<br>add $0, $4, $5</p>
<p>sub $21, $4, $6<br>sub $22, $4, $7<br>sub $23, $7, $7<br>sub $0, $4, $5</p>
<p>ori $8, $0, 0<br>sw $4, 0($8)<br>sw $5, 4($8)<br>sw $6, 8($8)<br>sw $7, 12($8)<br>sw $16, 16($8)<br>sw $17, 20($8)<br>sw $18, 24($8)<br>sw $19, 28($8)<br>sw $20, 32($8)<br>sw $21, 36($8)<br>sw $22, 40($8)<br>sw $23, 44($8)<br>sw $0, 56($8)</p>
<p>ori $14, $0, 0<br>lw $14, 0($8)<br>sw $14, 60($8)</p>
<p>ori $25, $0, 0<br>lw $25, 12($8)<br>sw $25, 64($8)</p>
<p>ori $28, $0, 0<br>lw $28, 28($8)<br>sw $28, 68($8)</p>
<p>ori $29, $0, 0<br>lw $29, 44($8)<br>sw $29, 72($8)</p>
<p>ori $30, $0, 4321<br>sw $30, 88($8)<br>ori $31, $0, 0<br>lw $31, 88($8)<br>sw $31, 92($8)</p>
<p>ori $3, $0, 1<br>ori $2, $0, 2<br>ori $1, $0, 1<br>beq $3, $2, loop1<br>beq $3, $1, loop2<br>beq $0, $0, loop3</p>
<h2 id="loop1-sw-3-76-8-loop2-sw-2-80-8-loop3-sw-1-84-8"><a href="#loop1-sw-3-76-8-loop2-sw-2-80-8-loop3-sw-1-84-8" class="headerlink" title="loop1: sw $3, 76($8)loop2: sw $2, 80($8)loop3: sw $1, 84($8)"></a>loop1: sw $3, 76($8)<br>loop2: sw $2, 80($8)<br>loop3: sw $1, 84($8)</h2><h2 id="思考题"><a href="#思考题" class="headerlink" title="思考题"></a>思考题</h2><ol>
<li><p>上面我们介绍了通过 FSM 理解单周期 CPU 的基本方法。请大家指出单周期 CPU 所用到的模块中，哪些发挥状态存储功能，哪些发挥状态转移功能。</p>
<p> 存储：IM，GRF，DM<br> 状态转移：IFU，ALU</p>
</li>
<li><p>现在我们的模块中 IM 使用 ROM， DM 使用 RAM， GRF 使用 Register，这种做法合理吗？ 请给出分析，若有改进意见也请一并给出。</p>
<p> 合理。IM将地址转化为指令的机器码，在程序运行中不希望被修改，所以选择ROM合适；DM要读出内存中的内容，还要往内存中写入，用RAM合适；IM和DM不方便寄存器，因为需要很大的一片空间；GRF是寄存器堆，使用寄存器能很好的实现功能。</p>
</li>
<li><p>在上述提示的模块之外，你是否在实际实现时设计了其他的模块？如果是的话，请给出介绍和设计的思路。</p>
<p>无</p>
</li>
<li><p>事实上，实现 nop 空指令，我们并不需要将它加入控制信号真值表，为什么？</p>
<p> 控制器使用优先译码器来决定指令类型，nop指令的type为0，GRF和DM的WE均为0，不会改变CPU的状态</p>
</li>
<li><p>阅读 MIPS 单元“6.1 测试程序设计”一节中给出的测试样例，评价其强度（可从各个指令的覆盖情况，单一指令各种行为的覆盖情况等方面分析），并指出具体的不足之处。</p>
<p> 没有测试sub指令；数据范围没有测试上下限；</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr>
]]></content>
  </entry>
